{
  "_nota": "Botón 'Ver recorrido aéreo 360°' en la columna del plano + la capa del visor. El visor se apoya en el comportamiento visor-embed (plugin 0.3.3): carga el iframe recién al abrir y lo descarga al cerrar.",
  "mode": "append",
  "styles": [
    {
      "selector": ".plano-360",
      "style": {
        "display": "flex",
        "align-items": "center",
        "justify-content": "center",
        "gap": "8px",
        "width": "100%",
        "margin-top": "14px",
        "margin-right": "0px",
        "margin-bottom": "18px",
        "margin-left": "0px",
        "padding-top": "11px",
        "padding-right": "18px",
        "padding-bottom": "11px",
        "padding-left": "18px",
        "border-style": "solid",
        "border-width": "1px",
        "border-color": "rgba(205,162,60,0.55)",
        "border-radius": "999px",
        "background-color": "transparent",
        "color": "#CDA23C",
        "font-family": "Montserrat, sans-serif",
        "font-size": "11px",
        "font-weight": "700",
        "letter-spacing": "0.44px",
        "text-transform": "uppercase",
        "text-decoration": "none",
        "cursor": "pointer",
        "transition": "background-color .18s ease, color .18s ease, border-color .18s ease"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".plano-360:hover",
      "style": {
        "background-color": "#CDA23C",
        "border-color": "#CDA23C",
        "color": "#2B2210"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".plano-360:focus-visible",
      "style": {
        "background-color": "#CDA23C",
        "border-color": "#CDA23C",
        "color": "#2B2210"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".plano-360__icono",
      "style": {
        "width": "15px",
        "height": "15px",
        "flex-grow": "0",
        "flex-shrink": "0",
        "flex-basis": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".visor360",
      "style": {
        "position": "fixed",
        "top": "0px",
        "right": "0px",
        "bottom": "0px",
        "left": "0px",
        "z-index": "9000",
        "display": "flex",
        "flex-direction": "column",
        "background-color": "rgba(20,17,9,0.94)",
        "opacity": "0",
        "pointer-events": "none",
        "transition": "opacity .25s ease"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".visor360.is-open",
      "style": {
        "opacity": "1",
        "pointer-events": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".visor360__barra",
      "style": {
        "display": "flex",
        "align-items": "center",
        "justify-content": "space-between",
        "gap": "16px",
        "padding-top": "14px",
        "padding-right": "20px",
        "padding-bottom": "14px",
        "padding-left": "20px"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".visor360__titulo",
      "style": {
        "font-family": "Montserrat, sans-serif",
        "font-size": "12px",
        "font-weight": "700",
        "letter-spacing": "1.2px",
        "text-transform": "uppercase",
        "color": "#CDA23C",
        "margin-top": "0px",
        "margin-right": "0px",
        "margin-bottom": "0px",
        "margin-left": "0px"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".visor360__cerrar",
      "style": {
        "border-style": "solid",
        "border-width": "1px",
        "border-color": "rgba(246,246,243,0.35)",
        "background-color": "transparent",
        "color": "#F6F6F3",
        "border-radius": "999px",
        "padding-top": "7px",
        "padding-right": "16px",
        "padding-bottom": "7px",
        "padding-left": "16px",
        "font-family": "Montserrat, sans-serif",
        "font-size": "11px",
        "font-weight": "700",
        "letter-spacing": "0.5px",
        "cursor": "pointer",
        "transition": "background-color .18s ease, color .18s ease"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".visor360__cerrar:hover",
      "style": {
        "background-color": "#F6F6F3",
        "color": "#2B2210"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".visor360__marco",
      "style": {
        "flex-grow": "1",
        "flex-shrink": "1",
        "flex-basis": "0%",
        "border-style": "none",
        "border-width": "0px",
        "width": "100%",
        "background-color": "#000000"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".visor360__barra",
      "media": "(max-width: 720px)",
      "style": {
        "padding-top": "10px",
        "padding-right": "12px",
        "padding-bottom": "10px",
        "padding-left": "12px",
        "gap": "10px"
      }
    },
    {
      "selector": ".visor360__titulo",
      "media": "(max-width: 720px)",
      "style": {
        "font-size": "10px",
        "letter-spacing": "0.8px"
      }
    }
  ],
  "structure": [
    {
      "tag": "button",
      "classes": ["plano-360"],
      "parent": ".plano-frame__side",
      "at": 2,
      "attributes": {
        "type": "button",
        "id": "abrir-recorrido-360",
        "aria-label": "Ver el recorrido aéreo 360 grados del proyecto"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "svg",
          "classes": ["plano-360__icono"],
          "attributes": {
            "viewBox": "0 0 24 24",
            "width": "15",
            "height": "15",
            "fill": "none",
            "stroke": "currentColor",
            "stroke-width": "1.8",
            "stroke-linecap": "round",
            "aria-hidden": "true",
            "focusable": "false"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "_nota": "El ecuador visto en perspectiva. Va como trazado y no como <ellipse> porque el sanitizador del documento no admite esa etiqueta, y no vale la pena ampliar una lista de seguridad por un ícono.",
              "tag": "path",
              "attributes": { "d": "M2 12a10 4.6 0 1 0 20 0 10 4.6 0 1 0-20 0z" }
            },
            {
              "tag": "path",
              "attributes": { "d": "M12 2.2a9.8 9.8 0 0 1 0 19.6 9.8 9.8 0 0 1 0-19.6z" }
            },
            {
              "tag": "path",
              "attributes": { "d": "M2.2 12h19.6" }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "text": "Ver recorrido aéreo 360°"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "classes": ["visor360"],
      "parent": ".mapa-interactivo",
      "attributes": {
        "id": "visor-recorrido-360",
        "role": "dialog",
        "aria-modal": "true",
        "aria-label": "Recorrido aéreo 360 grados",
        "data-cod-behavior": "visor-embed",
        "data-cod-visor-trigger": "#abrir-recorrido-360",
        "data-cod-visor-src": "https://www.diegoelgueta.cl/360/fundosantaluisa/",
        "data-cod-visor-frame": ".visor360__marco",
        "data-cod-visor-close": ".visor360__cerrar",
        "data-cod-visor-open-class": "is-open"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "classes": ["visor360__barra"],
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "classes": ["visor360__titulo"],
              "text": "Recorrido aéreo · Santa Luisa de Palpi"
            },
            {
              "tag": "button",
              "classes": ["visor360__cerrar"],
              "attributes": {
                "type": "button",
                "aria-label": "Cerrar el recorrido"
              },
              "text": "Cerrar ✕"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "iframe",
          "classes": ["visor360__marco"],
          "attributes": {
            "title": "Recorrido aéreo 360° de Santa Luisa de Palpi",
            "allowfullscreen": "true",
            "loading": "lazy"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
